  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#DERGroupDispatch">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Specifies the capabilities of the DER Group that are to be dispatched according to a schedule. Each dispatch identifies a DER Group and the specific monitorable parameter to be dispatched over a specific time interval.</rdfs:comment>
