    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Real power in Watt (J/s). Electrical power may have real and reactive components. The real portion of electrical power (I�R or VIcos(phi)), is expressed in Watts. (See also apparent power and reactive power.)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61968.ttl" />
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">W</rdfs:label>
