  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#DimensionsInfo">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">As applicable, the basic linear, area, or volume dimensions of an asset, asset type (AssetModel) or other type of object (such as land area). Units and multipliers are specified per dimension.</rdfs:comment>
