  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#ErpInvoice.proForma">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">True if payment is to be paid by a Customer to accept a particular ErpQuote (with associated Design) and have work initiated, at which time an associated ErpInvoice should automatically be generated. EprPayment.subjectStatus satisfies terms specificed in the ErpQuote.</rdfs:comment>
