    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Total dissolved combustible gas concentration (in ppm, specifically in microlitre/litre). Calculated by adding the ppm of combustible gasses: hydrogen (H2), methane (CH4), ethane (C2H6), ethylene (C2H4), acetylene (C2H2), and carbon monoxide (CO).</rdfs:comment>
