    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#OilAnalysisPaperAnalogKind" />
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Furfuryl alcohol (2FOL) (in ppb). Also known as: 2-furyl alcohol, 2-furfurol, 2- furylmethanol, 2-hydroxymethylfuran, 2-furancarbinol, furancarbinol, 2- furanmethanol, furanmethanol, furfural alcohol, and alpha-furylcarbinol.</rdfs:comment>
