  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#SwitchingEvent">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Event indicating the completion (success or fail) of any switching action (jumper action, cut action, tag action, etc). The switching action may or may not be a consequential event in response to a request to complete the action.</rdfs:comment>
